<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Tuesday, slaughter steers and heifers sold steady in a very light test. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 package 1170 lbs 62.75.  Few Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 59.00-61.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 package 1118 lbs 62.70.</p>
</text>
